WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.212
I'm Pylon.

00:00:02.812 --> 00:00:04.556
I inspect claims at the harbour.

00:00:05.576 --> 00:00:08.773
A cone means nobody
has checked this one yet.

00:00:09.373 --> 00:00:11.872
I put one on every claim that washes in.

00:00:12.892 --> 00:00:14.981
There are more claims than cones.

00:00:15.581 --> 00:00:18.888
So I check what I can,
I show you where it came from,

00:00:18.888 --> 00:00:20.912
and I tell you what is still waiting.

00:00:21.932 --> 00:00:23.213
I won't guess for you.

00:00:23.813 --> 00:00:24.641
Your call.
